content.text:
The root cause is geo, and the rest of the degradation follows from it. I'm not naming a separate fault for rate, profile or reservation, since the data shows their drops are volume effects.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "geo",
      "fault_kind": "pod_unavailable",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "metric",
          "sql": "SELECT time, attr_k8s_pod_name, metric, value FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE service_name='geo' AND metric IN ('k8s.container.ready','k8s.container.restarts') ORDER BY metric, time",
          "claim": "geo container ready drops to 0 at 19:17:05 and stays 0 to the end; restart count climbs 10 to 12 on the same pod"
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT 'abnormal' AS period, count(*) AS geo_spans FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='geo' UNION ALL SELECT 'normal', count(*) FROM normal_traces WHERE service_name='geo'",
          "claim": "geo emits no spans during the abnormal window, versus 1482 spans in the normal window"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "geo",
      "to": "search",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name IN ('search') AND span_name LIKE '%geo%' GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "search's calls to geo.Geo/Nearby all end in Error; search then returns errors upstream"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "search",
      "to": "frontend",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE (service_name='frontend' AND span_name='HTTP /hotels') OR (service_name='frontend' AND span_name='search.Search/Nearby' AND attr_span_kind='Client') GROUP BY ALL",
          "claim": "frontend /hotels server spans return HTTP 500 with Error status, matching failed search calls; /hotels error share is 99.6%"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

